{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "depoimento-cliente",
  "name": "Depoimento de cliente",
  "description": "Prova social em 9:16: o cliente conta como era antes, o que mudou e para quem recomenda.",
  "canvas": {
    "width": 1080,
    "height": 1920
  },
  "fps": 30,
  "resolutions": [
    1080,
    720
  ],
  "intro": {
    "duration": 2.5,
    "background": {
      "type": "gradient",
      "from": "#0f3d3e",
      "to": "#1fa37a",
      "angle": 160
    },
    "layers": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "asset": "logo.svg",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.4,
        "width": 0.55,
        "start": 0,
        "animation": "pop",
        "animationDuration": 0.5
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "O que nossos clientes dizem",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.53,
        "align": "center",
        "fontSize": 0.042,
        "fontWeight": 700,
        "color": "#ffffff",
        "start": 0.4,
        "animation": "slide-up",
        "shadow": true,
        "maxWidth": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
  "slots": [
    {
      "id": "cliente",
      "label": "Quem é você",
      "script": "Oi! Eu sou [seu nome], [seu cargo] na [sua empresa].\nA gente trabalha com [o que a empresa faz].",
      "minDuration": 3,
      "maxDuration": 15,
      "fit": "cover",
      "layers": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{{slot.label}}",
          "x": 0.06,
          "y": 0.86,
          "align": "left",
          "fontSize": 0.03,
          "fontWeight": 800,
          "color": "#ffffff",
          "background": {
            "color": "#1fa37a",
            "padding": 0.012
          },
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 4.5,
          "animation": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "antes",
      "label": "Como era antes",
      "script": "Antes, o nosso maior problema era [o problema].\nIsso fazia a gente [o impacto: perder tempo, dinheiro, clientes].",
      "minDuration": 5,
      "maxDuration": 25,
      "fit": "cover",
      "layers": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{{slot.label}}",
          "x": 0.06,
          "y": 0.86,
          "align": "left",
          "fontSize": 0.03,
          "fontWeight": 800,
          "color": "#ffffff",
          "background": {
            "color": "#1fa37a",
            "padding": 0.012
          },
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 4.5,
          "animation": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "depois",
      "label": "O que mudou",
      "script": "Com a [nome do produto], a gente passou a [o que mudou].\nHoje [um resultado concreto, de preferência com número].",
      "minDuration": 5,
      "maxDuration": 25,
      "fit": "cover",
      "layers": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{{slot.label}}",
          "x": 0.06,
          "y": 0.86,
          "align": "left",
          "fontSize": 0.03,
          "fontWeight": 800,
          "color": "#ffffff",
          "background": {
            "color": "#1fa37a",
            "padding": 0.012
          },
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 4.5,
          "animation": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "recomendacao",
      "label": "Recomendação",
      "script": "Eu recomendo para quem [perfil de quem deveria usar].\nVale muito a pena!",
      "minDuration": 3,
      "maxDuration": 15,
      "fit": "cover",
      "layers": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{{slot.label}}",
          "x": 0.06,
          "y": 0.86,
          "align": "left",
          "fontSize": 0.03,
          "fontWeight": 800,
          "color": "#ffffff",
          "background": {
            "color": "#1fa37a",
            "padding": 0.012
          },
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 4.5,
          "animation": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "outro": {
    "duration": 3,
    "background": {
      "type": "color",
      "color": "#0f3d3e"
    },
    "layers": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "asset": "logo.svg",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.42,
        "width": 0.5,
        "start": 0,
        "animation": "fade",
        "animationDuration": 0.5
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Seja o próximo caso de sucesso",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.56,
        "align": "center",
        "fontSize": 0.038,
        "fontWeight": 700,
        "color": "#bff3dd",
        "start": 0.3,
        "animation": "slide-up",
        "shadow": true,
        "maxWidth": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
  "logo": {
    "asset": "logo.svg",
    "position": "top-right",
    "width": 0.24,
    "margin": 0.05,
    "opacity": 0.85,
    "showOn": "slots"
  },
  "music": {
    "asset": "trilha-leve.wav",
    "volume": 0.5,
    "duckedVolume": 0.08,
    "fadeIn": 0.8,
    "fadeOut": 1.5
  },
  "transition": {
    "type": "fade-black",
    "duration": 0.25
  }
}
